{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">百利保控股截至六月底止中期虧損按年收窄六成半，蝕近2.1億元。經營盈利超過3億元，上一年度同期蝕3.7億元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入增長近兩成九，超過15億元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T01:25:07.585848+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}